    "PeacockPluginUpdateWarningDesc" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Peacock plugins included with this mod have changed, or new plugins have been introduced. If you use the Peacock server emulator after applying this mod, its plugins will be able to run their own code, giving the mod's author complete control over your PC. Make sure you trust whoever developed this mod, and wherever you originally downloaded it from. Are you sure you want to update this mod?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此模组包含的 Peacock 插件已更改，或新插件已启用。如果您在应用此模组后使用了 Peacock 模拟服务器， 它的插件将能够运行自己的代码，让模组作者完全控制您的 PC。请确保您信任此模组的开发者以及下载来源。您确定要更新这个模组吗？"
